SCOPE OF THIS LICENSE

This license covers the entire contents of this repository: the NovaProtect
protection engine (src/, include/, runtime/), the test suites (tests/), the
WinUI 3 client (ui/), the static website (website/), the integration SDK (sdk/),
the installer scripts (installer/) and the release tooling (tools/).

Third-party components keep their own terms and are not covered here:

  - VMProtect SDK (commercial; not redistributed in this repository - the engine
    builds without it via the NOVAPROTECT_VMP_STUB define)
  - Inno Setup 6/7 (its own license, see installer/)
  - the Windows App SDK and .NET runtime (Microsoft terms)
